  "description": "Shared data types of the OpenFOAM case controller and the rules a case obeys: the case (base files, allow-listed recipe, response request, artifact policy), one variant's run (the case and its token values) and its outcome (per-step exit codes and times, convergence facts, the extracted response row, the artifact reference); the allow-list, recipe grammar, case-path, response, token-coverage and run-time-code rules, byte-exact substitution and the solver-class vocabulary, shared by the node, the Sweep host and client preflight. Consumed by the node controller, the Sweep orchestration controller and client applications.",
